/bin/
*.test
*.out
/coverage*
.env
__pycache__/
# Recordings and raw TikTok answers stay local (docs/tiktok/build-brief.md §7).
# HARs go only under .local/har/.
/.local/
*.har
*.har.gz
*.har.zip
# Probe and Phase 0: credentials, the account list and results stay local.
# Everything in phase0/ is ignored except the kit's own files (added with them).
/phase0/*
!/phase0/proxies.example.yaml
!/phase0/tt-accounts.example.txt
